@startuml Context_Diagram
title System Context Diagram - Hotel Management System

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #4A90D9
    BorderColor #2C3E50
    FontColor #FFFFFF
    Padding 10
}

' Central System
rectangle "<b>HOTEL MANAGEMENT SYSTEM</b>\n(Next.js + MongoDB)" as System {
    note right of System
        <b>Core Capabilities:</b>
        - Room Booking Management
        - Food & Order Processing
        - Tour Package Bookings
        - Invoice & Payment
        - Guest Feedback System
        - Staff Administration
    end note
}

' External Entities
participant "<b>Guest</b>\n(Customers)" as Guest
participant "<b>Admin</b>\n(System Manager)" as Admin
participant "<b>Receptionist</b>\n(Front Desk)" as Receptionist
participant "<b>Waiter</b>\n(Staff)" as Waiter
participant "<b>Payment Gateway</b>\n(External Service)" as Payment

' Relationships
Guest -> System : Browse Rooms & Tours
Guest -> System : Make Bookings
Guest -> System : Submit Feedback/Complaints
Guest -> System : View Orders

Admin -> System : User Management
Admin -> System : System Configuration
Admin -> System : View Analytics

Receptionist -> System : Check-in/Check-out
Receptionist -> System : Manage Reservations
Receptionist -> System : Process Orders

Waiter -> System : Add Food Orders
Waiter -> System : Update Order Status

Payment -> System : Process Payments (webhook)
System -> Payment : Charge Cards

' Lines for clarity
Guest ..> System : demands
Admin ..> System : manages
Receptionist ..> System : operates
Waiter ..> System : uses

@enduml